// Phib's puzzles: Phibber the frog's first five. Every
// behaviour, Phibber's hops included, is a recipe you can read, and the
// standard library's are in std/.
use std

level puzzle1 "Stepping Logs"
intro "Phibber can’t swim. Push a log into the pond and it becomes a raft you can stand on. Reach the lotus."
hint "The pond is two wide, so you need two rafts in a row. Push the first log in, step onto it, and push the second log from the raft."
goal Frog at 8, 3
// Recipes this pond can never use: nothing here makes what they need.
without chop
without ford sink
without furnace smelt burnout
without rail build drive shove turn wear
without veinwait vein
without toll open
without slip slide skate stop
without convey
without light spread burn ignite blast fizzle
without clone spent
without sprout grow
without bankore bankingot
without antright antleft antturn
solution "NEENESSWWSEEEEEENE"
map
  ##########   ..........
  #....~~..#   ..........
  #....~~..#   ...l......
  #....~~..#   .@........
  #....~~..#   ...l......
  #....~~..#   ..........
  ##########   ..........

level puzzle2 "Ford"
intro "A stone pushed into water fills it with a ford you can walk on. Unlike a raft, it stays put. Get the ore to the lotus."
hint "Ore sinks if it touches water, so the ore needs dry ground or a ford all the way across. Fill the river first."
goal Loose(Ore, _) at 7, 3
// Recipes this pond can never use: nothing here makes what they need.
without chop
without drift driftBare board boardLeft boardRight leapBoard leapBoardLeft leapBoardRight onto ontoLeft ontoRight leapOnto leapOntoLeft leapOntoRight hopOn ride raft wake unload
without smelt
without rail build drive shove turn wear
without veinwait vein
without toll open
without slip slide skate stop
without convey
without light spread burn ignite blast fizzle
without clone spent
without sprout grow
without bankore bankingot
without antright antleft antturn
solution "NENESWWSE.EEEE"
map
  ##########   ..........
  #...v....#   ..........
  #...v....#   ..s.......
  #...v....#   .@o.......
  #...v....#   ..........
  ##########   ..........

level puzzle3 "Downstream"
intro "Rafts on moving water drift, carrying whatever is on them. The far bank is walled off except for one landing. Ride there."
hint "Push the log into the river at the top, step on, and wait. Hop off when you’re beside the landing."
goal Frog at 8, 1
// Recipes this pond can never use: nothing here makes what they need.
without chop
without ford sink
without furnace smelt burnout
without rail build drive shove turn wear
without veinwait vein
without toll open
without slip slide skate stop
without convey
without light spread burn ignite blast fizzle
without clone spent
without sprout grow
without bankore bankingot
without antright antleft antturn
solution "ENENNEENNNEE"
map
  ##########   ..........
  #...v#...#   ..@l......
  #...v#...#   ..........
  #...v#...#   ..........
  ##..v....#   ..........
  ##..v#...#   ..........
  ##########   ..........

level puzzle4 "Smelter"
intro "Four stones in a square make a furnace. A log and ore on opposite sides of the furnace make an ingot. Get an ingot onto the lotus."
hint "Finish the square first: the furnace appears in its top-left corner. Then line up log, furnace, ore."
goal Loose(Ingot, _) at 7, 3
// Recipes this pond can never use: nothing here makes what they need.
without chop
without drift driftBare board boardLeft boardRight leapBoard leapBoardLeft leapBoardRight onto ontoLeft ontoRight leapOnto leapOntoLeft leapOntoRight hopOn ride raft ford sink adrift wake unload
without veinwait vein
without toll open
without slip slide skate stop
without convey
without light spread burn ignite blast fizzle
without clone spent
without sprout grow
without bankore bankingot
without antright antleft antturn
solution "EEWNESEENEESWWNENWNWWSSEEE"
