  #########   .........

level puzzle5 "Rail Yard"
intro "Here the track isn’t floor: Phibber can’t hop onto it or push anything along it. Two logs beside two ingots, with the upper ingot on the track, become a cart facing away from the logs. It rolls by itself and shoves whatever is ahead. Deliver the ore to the lotus at the end of the line."
hint "The cart appears where the upper ingot is. Build it at the start of the track, with the logs to its west."
// Here the track isn't floor.
pattern floor -= Rail
goal Loose(Ore, _) at 9, 3
// Recipes this pond can never use: nothing here makes what they need.
without chop
without drift driftBare board boardLeft boardRight leapBoard leapBoardLeft leapBoardRight onto ontoLeft ontoRight leapOnto leapOntoLeft leapOntoRight hopOn ride raft ford sink adrift wake unload
without furnace smelt burnout
without veinwait vein
without toll open
without slip slide skate stop
without convey
without light spread burn ignite blast fizzle
without clone spent
without sprout grow
without bankore bankingot
without antright antleft antturn
